('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_543','sort','sɔrt','sɔːt','[n] 种类; [vt&vi] 分类','Most of the victims developed psychological problems of one sort or another (= of various different types ) .  大多数受害者都出现了这样那样的心理问题。'),
