('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_598','swamp','swɑmp','swɒmp','[n] 沼泽地，使淹没','I spent one whole night by a swamp behind the road listening to frogs.  我整个晚上都在这条路后面的一个沼泽地旁听蛙鸣。'),
