('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_939','denial','dɪ''naɪəl','dɪ''naɪ(ə)l','[n] 拒绝，否认，否定','It seems clear that despite official denials, differences of opinion lay behind the ambassador''s decision to quit.  很清楚，尽管官方否认，人们对大使决定辞职还是有不同看法。'),
