('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_941','onset','''ɑnsɛt','''ɒnset','[n] 进攻；开始，发作','the onset of winter  冬天的来临'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_942','native','''netɪv','''neɪtɪv','[adj] 天真的，幼稚的','her native wit  她天生的机智风趣'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_943','overwrought',',ovɚ''rɔt','əʊvə''rɔːt','[adj] 过分劳累的，过度兴奋的','Clara was tired and overwrought after all the problems of the last few days.  经历了过去几天的重重困难之后，克拉拉既疲惫又紧张。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_944','roast','rost','rəʊst','[v&a] 烤(的)，烘(的)','Are you going to roast the chicken?  这鸡你是准备烤的吗？'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_945','survey','ˈsɝˌve; (for v.) sɝˈve','ˈsəːveɪ; (for v.) səˈveɪ','[vt&n] 环视，眺望；测量；勘定；检查；概述','a survey of modern English literature  现代英国文学概论'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_946','profile','''profaɪl','''prəʊfaɪl','[n] 侧面；轮廓','Dani has a lovely profile.  达尼的侧面轮廓很好看。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_947','offspring','''ɔfsprɪŋ','''ɒfsprɪŋ','[n] 子孙后代；动物的幼仔','a lion and its offspring  一头狮子和它的幼崽'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_948','practicable','''præktɪkəbl','''præktɪkəb(ə)l','[adj] 可实行的；能用的，可行的','The only practicable course of action is to sell the company.  唯一可行的做法是把公司卖掉。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_949','discharge','dɪs''tʃɑrdʒ','dɪs''tʃɑːdʒ','[v&n] 卸货；排出(液体，气体)；释放','Hospitals now tend to discharge patients earlier than in the past.  与过去相比，现在医院更趋向于让病人早些出院。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_950','chorus','''kɔrəs','''kɔːrəs','[n&vt] 合唱；齐声说','I sing with the university chorus.  我在大学合唱队里唱歌。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_951','statute','''stætʃut','''stætjuːt; -tʃuːt','[n] 法令，法规','Protection for the consumer is laid down by statute (= established by law ) .  保障消费者权益已有法律明文规定。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_952','latitude','''lætɪtud','''lætɪtjuːd','[n] 纬度；地区；(言论，行动的)自由','The birds breed in northern latitudes.  这些鸟在北纬地区繁殖。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_953','rot','rɑt','rɒt','[v&n] 腐掉','Candy will rot your teeth.  吃糖会腐蚀牙齿。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_954','phase','fez','feɪz','[n] 阶段；月的盈亏；方面;相位vt按计划进行','a new drug that is in the experimental phase  处于试验阶段的一种新药'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_955','ruffle','''rʌfl','''rʌf(ə)l','[vt&vi] 扰乱，打扰','He ruffled her hair affectionately.  他亲昵地拨弄她的头发。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_956','diverse','daɪ''vɝs','daɪ''vɜːs; ''daɪvɜːs','[adj] 多种多样的','subjects as diverse as pop music and archaeology  像流行音乐和考古学这样各不相同的学科'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_957','wicked','''wɪkɪd','''wɪkɪd','[adj] 坏的；邪恶的','the wicked stepmother in ‘Hansel and Gretel’  《糖果屋》中那个恶毒的继母'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_958','omit','ə''mɪt','ə(ʊ)''mɪt','[v] 疏忽，忘记；省略；遗漏','Please don’t omit any details, no matter how trivial they may seem.  请不要忽略任何细节，不管它多细小。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_959','diploma','dɪ''plomə','dɪ''pləʊmə','[n] 毕业证书，文凭','I’m hoping to get my teaching diploma this year.  我希望今年能拿到教师证书。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_960','crack','kræk','kræk','[n] 裂缝，破裂声；v使破裂；噼啪作响；解开','She opened the door a crack and peeped into the room.  她把门打开一条缝，往房间里偷看。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_961','remittance','rɪ''mɪtns','rɪ''mɪt(ə)ns','[n] 汇款(海外)，汇款额','Please enclose your remittance, making checks payable to Valley Technology Services.  请随信附上您的汇款，支票收款方为瓦利科技服务公司。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_962','vibrate','vaɪ''breɪt','vaɪ''breɪt','[v] 摆动；振动','The floor was vibrating to the beat of the music.  地板随着音乐的节奏在颤动。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_963','controversy','ˈkɑːntrəvɜːrsi','''kɒntrəvɜːsɪ; kən''trɒvəsɪ','[n] 论战','a political controversy  政治争议'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_964','microbe','''maɪkrob','''maɪkrəʊb','[n] 微生物','...a type of bacteria that include the microbes responsible for tuberculosis and leprosy.  …包括引起结核病和麻风病的微生物在内的一类细菌。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_965','frustrate','''frʌstret','frʌ''streɪt; ''frʌs-','[v] 挫败；阻挠','Their attempts to speak to him were frustrated by the guards.  他们想跟他说话，但被警卫拦住了。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_966','omen','''omən','''əʊmən','[n] 预兆，征兆','The car won’t start. Do you think it’s an omen?  汽车发动不起来。你觉得这是某种预兆吗？'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_967','fraught','frɔt','frɔːt','[adj] 充满的；伴随的','The earliest operations employing this technique were fraught with dangers.  最早采用这一技术的手术充满了危险。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_968','disclose','dɪs''kloz','dɪs''kləʊz','[v] 透露，泄露','Some companies have already voluntarily disclosed similar information .  一些公司已经主动透露了类似的信息。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_969','superb','/suːˈpɜːrb/','suː''pɜːb; sjuː-','[adj] 壮丽的，头等的','The food was superb.  食物好吃极了。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_970','talented','''tæləntɪd','''tæləntɪd','[adj] 有才能的，有才干的','a talented actor  一名很有天赋的演员'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_971','hydrogen','''haɪdrədʒən','''haɪdrədʒ(ə)n','[n] 氢气','Water contains hydrogen and oxygen.  水含有氢和氧。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_972','stagnant','''stægnənt','''stægnənt','[adj] 不流动的；不变的，不景气的','a stagnant pond  死水塘'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_973','obstacle','''ɑbstəkl','''ɒbstək(ə)l','[n] 障碍','The tax puts obstacles in the way of companies trying to develop trade overseas.  这项税收为想在海外发展贸易的公司设置了障碍。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_974','pour','pɔr','pɔː','[vt&vi] (液体)倒,注,灌；流入，流出"','She poured coffee for everyone.  她为每个人都倒了咖啡。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_975','respiration',',rɛspə''reʃən','respɪ''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 呼吸作用；一次呼吸；植物光合作用','His respiration grew fainter throughout the day.  一天当中，他的呼吸越来越微弱。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_976','aware','ə''wɛr','ə''weə','[adj] 知道的，意识的','Mr Braley has been made aware of the need for absolute secrecy.  布雷利先生被告知需要绝对保密。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_977','sectional','''sɛkʃənl','''sekʃ(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 各部分组成的，各阶层或不同部分的','community groups seeking to protect sectional interests  致力保护群体利益的社区组织'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_978','crisis','''kraɪsɪs','''kraɪsɪs','[n] 转折点；危机','The country now faces an economic crisis .  该国目前正面临一场经济危机。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_979','procure','prə''kjʊr','prə''kjʊə','[v] (努力)取得；获得','It remained very difficult to procure food, fuel, and other daily necessities.  当时仍然很难获得食品、燃料和其他日用必需品。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_980','trigger','''trɪɡɚ','''trɪgə','[n] (枪)扳机; [v] 引起，激发','A man pointed a gun at them and pulled the trigger.  一个男人用枪指着他们，扣动了扳机。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_981','discrete','dɪ''skrit','dɪ''skriːt','[adj] 分离的，不相关联的','The change happens in a series of discrete steps.  这个变化在一系列分离的步骤中发生。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_982','stabilize','''stebəlaɪz','''steɪbəlaɪz','[v] 使稳定，使坚固，使安定','The patient’s condition has now stabilized.  病人的情况现已稳定下来了。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_983','nursery','''nɝsəri','''nɜːs(ə)rɪ','[n] 保育室，托儿所','He has painted murals in his children''s nursery.  他在他家的育儿室画上了壁画。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_984','apt','æpt','æpt','[adj] 聪明的；合适的；易于的','‘Love at first sight’ is a very apt description of how he felt when he saw her.  用“一见钟情”来形容他见到她时的感觉再恰当不过。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_985','whip','wɪp','wɪp','[n] 鞭子；政党的组织秘书; [v] 鞭笞；抽打','The coachman cracked his whip and the carriage lurched forward.  马车夫甩了一记响鞭，马车猛然向前冲去。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_986','protest','ˈproʊtest','''prəʊtest','[v] 抗议；申明; [n] 抗议；反对','‘I don’t see why I should take the blame for this!’ she protested.  “我不明白为什么我要对此承担责任！”她抗议道。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_987','thigh','θaɪ','θaɪ','[n] 大腿，股','chicken thighs  鸡腿'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_988','trickle','''trɪkl','''trɪk(ə)l','[v&n] (使)滴流，(使)细流','The water in the stream had been reduced to a trickle.  小溪里的水已只剩下一股细流。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_989','reward','rɪ''wɔrd','rɪ''wɔːd','[n&v] 奖赏','The school has a system of rewards and punishments to encourage good behaviour.  学校有奖惩制度以鼓励良好行为。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_990','outlaw','''aʊtlɔ','''aʊtlɔː','[n] 被剥夺公民权者; [v] 禁止','The bill would have outlawed several types of guns.  这项法案将全面禁用几种枪支。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_991','chisel','''tʃɪzl','''tʃɪz(ə)l','[n&vt] 凿子，錾子；凿，雕','He set out to chisel a dog out of sandstone.  他开始用凿子将砂岩雕刻成一只狗。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_992','ideal','aɪ''diəl','aɪ''dɪəl; aɪ''diːəl','[n] 理想的事物；理想; [adj] 完美的，理想的','Walt Disney stayed true to his ideals.  沃尔特·迪斯尼坚持他的理想。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_993','rivet','''rɪvɪt','''rɪvɪt','[n] 铆钉; [v] 铆接，铆牢；集中(目光或注意力)','The West Ham crest features two crossed rivet hammers and the club has been known has the Hammers ever since  球队的队徽上有两个交叉的铆钉锤，这也让人们把球队和铁锤联系在一起。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_994','equitable','''ekwitəbl','''ekwɪtəb(ə)l','[adj] 公平的；公正的','an equitable distribution of food supplies  所供应食品的合理分配'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_995','thesaurus','θɪ''sɔrəs','θɪ''sɔːrəs','[n] 词典，同类词汇编',''),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_996','penetrate','''pɛnətret','''penɪtreɪt','[v] 穿过；透过','bullets that penetrate thick armour plating  穿过厚装甲的子弹'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_997','dilate','daɪˈlet','daɪ''leɪt; dɪ-','[v] 使膨胀，扩大','dilated pupils  扩大的瞳孔'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_998','participate','pɑr''tɪsə''pet','pɑː''tɪsɪpeɪt','[v] 参与，分享','Some members refused to participate.  有些会员拒绝参加。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_999','provision','prə''vɪʒn','prə''vɪʒ(ə)n','[n] 准备；供应；条款','The agreement includes a provision for each side to check the other side’s weapons.  协议有项规定，允许双方互查武器。'),
