('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1020','foul','faʊl','faʊl','[adj] 恶臭的；邪恶的；暴风雨的n犯规v弄脏','He woke up with a foul taste in his mouth.  他醒过来，嘴里一股臭味。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1021','sacred','''sekrɪd','''seɪkrɪd','[adj] 神圣的','a sacred vow  神圣的誓言'),
