('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1301','composite','kɑm''pɑzɪt','''kɒmpəzɪt','[adj] 合成的，复合的','The author builds up a useful compo-site picture of contemporary consumer culture.  作者勾勒出了一幅实用的当代消费文化全景图。'),
