('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1310','submit','səb''mɪt','səb''mɪt','[v] (使)服从；提交','In desperation, Mrs. Jones submitted to an operation on her right knee to relieve the pain.  绝望中，琼斯夫人不得已接受了一次她右膝的手术以减轻疼痛。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1311','arrogant','''ærəɡənt','''ærəg(ə)nt','[adj] 傲慢的，自负的','He was unbearably arrogant.  他的傲慢让人无法忍受。'),
