('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1481','signal','''sɪgnl','''sɪgn(ə)l','[n&v] (发)信号','At a prearranged signal the lights went out.  预定的信号一发出，灯就全灭了。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1482','furnace','''fɝnɪs','''fɜːnɪs','[n] 炉子，熔炉','We had better fire up the furnace.  我们最好把炉子生起来。'),
