('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1484','minority','maɪ''nɔrəti','maɪ''nɒrɪtɪ; mɪ-','[n] 未成年；少数；少数民族','Gaelic is still spoken in Ireland by a tiny minority.  爱尔兰仍有极少数人在说盖尔语。'),
