('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1518','pungent','''pʌndʒənt','''pʌn(d)ʒ(ə)nt','[adj] 刺鼻的，刺激性的','He expressed some fairly pungent criticisms.  他提出了一针见血的批评。'),
('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1519','indulge','ɪn''dʌldʒ','ɪn''dʌldʒ','[v] 放纵，沉迷于','His mother spoiled him, indulging his every whim.  他母亲对他纵容娇惯，百依百顺。'),
