('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1525','sceptical','''skeptikəl','''skeptɪk(ə)l','[adj] 怀疑的，表示疑惑的','‘You can trust me,’ he said. Jane looked sceptical.  “你可以相信我。”他说。而简看上去一脸怀疑。'),
