('IELTSluan_2','IELTSluan_2_1606','aggravate','''æɡrəvet','''ægrəveɪt','[v] 使恶化；使加剧；使气恼','Their money problems were further aggravated by a rise in interest rates.  由于利率上调，他们的财务问题更加严重。'),
