('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_36','show','ʃo','ʃəʊ','演出','The man grinned, showing bad teeth.  那男人咧着嘴笑，露出一口坏牙。'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_37','magazine','''mæɡəzin','mægə''ziːn','杂志','a magazine article  杂志中的文章'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_38','better','''bɛtɚ','''betə','更好的','Your stereo is better than mine.  你的音响比我的好。'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_39','faster','''fastə','fɑ:stə(r)','更快的','Orders are starting to backlog faster than we can process them.  订货单正开始积压得比我们能对它们进行处理更快。(或：订单开始形成积压，我们来不及处理。)'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_40','hotel','ho''tɛl','həʊˈtel','旅馆','I’ve booked the flights and the hotel.  我已订好机票和酒店。'),
