('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_45','enjoy','ɪn''dʒɔɪ','ɪnˈdʒɔɪ','享受⋯⋯的乐趣','Sandra enjoys her job in the city.  桑德拉很喜欢她在城里的这份工作。'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_46','stay','ste','steɪ','暂住','How long are they going to stay?  他们打算住多久？'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_47','went','wɛnt','went','去','We all went except him.  除他以外， 我们都去了。'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_48','camp','kæmp','kæmp','野营','Let’s go back to camp – it’s getting dark.  我们回营地吧，天快黑了。'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_49','went camping','','','去野营','On a day of brilliant sunshine,we went camping.  在一个阳光明媚的日子，我们去野营。'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_50','fish','fɪʃ','fɪʃ','钓鱼','Over 1,500 different species of fish inhabit the waters around the reef.  那片礁石周围的水域生活着1,500多种不同的鱼类。'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_51','went fishing','','','去钓鱼','Yesterday we went fishing.  昨天我们去钓鱼了。'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_52','rode','rod','rəʊd','骑','His mother rode him on her back.  他的母亲让他骑在她的背上。'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_53','hurt','hɝ​t','hɜːt','受伤','Was anyone hurt in the accident?  事故中有人受伤吗？'),
('PEPXiaoXue6_2','PEPXiaoXue6_2_54','ate','ɛt; et','et; eit','吃','The boy ate several dishfuls of ice cream.  那小男孩吃了好几满盘冰淇淋。'),
